msgstr "Cinemática directa y cinemática inversa."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:594
msgid ""
":ref:`Tween <class_Tween>` node to easily perform procedural animations by "
"code."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Tween <class_Tween>` nodo para realizar fácilmente animaciones de "
