msgstr "Ajuste la propiedad ``Playing`` en el Inspector a \"On\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:44
msgid ""
"We'll select one of these animations randomly so that the mobs will have "
