msgid ""
"In our ``Character.gd`` script, we define a ``health_changed`` signal and "
"emit it with :ref:`Object.emit_signal() <class_Object_method_emit_signal>`, "
"and from a ``Game`` node higher up our scene tree, we connect it to the "
